{
  "tutorial": "setup-services",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "Build your services and pricing",
  "voice": "default",
  "mark": false,
  "sampleData": "Juniper Cleaning Co. after tutorial 1 (node tutorials/demo/seed.mjs company <label>). One fictional service, example prices.",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "narration": "Let's build your first service, so customers and your agents quote real prices.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "card",
        "eyebrow": "Setup guide · 2 of 6",
        "title": "Build your services and pricing",
        "body": "Add a service, price it, review it, and publish it so it can be booked.",
        "left": "Juniper Cleaning Co. is a fictional demo company. Prices are examples.",
        "seconds": 7
      },
      "minSeconds": 5
    },
    {
      "id": "start",
      "narration": "In Services and Pricing, you can start from a template, bring in a price list you already have, or add a service by hand. We'll add one by hand.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "playwright",
        "start": "/app/services",
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "hover",
            "target": "text=Start with a template",
            "ms": 800
          },
          {
            "do": "hover",
            "target": "text=Bring my existing pricing",
            "ms": 800
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "text=add a service by hand"
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": {
              "role": "textbox",
              "name": "Name customers will see"
            },
            "cut": true
          }
        ]
      },
      "minSeconds": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "name",
      "narration": "Give it the name customers will see, choose the kind of cleaning, and start building. It stays a draft until you publish it.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "playwright",
        "start": "/app/services/new?mode=blank",
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "type",
            "target": {
              "role": "textbox",
              "name": "Name customers will see"
            },
            "text": "Standard home cleaning"
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "text=Residential >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Start building"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": "text=Step 1 of 6",
            "cut": true
          },
          {
            "do": "pause",
            "ms": 800
          }
        ]
      },
      "minSeconds": 7
    },
    {
      "id": "pricing",
      "narration": "In Pricing, choose how you charge. Bedrooms and bathrooms works well for homes. Enter a base price, then what each extra bedroom and bathroom adds. The same answers estimate how long the clean takes.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "playwright",
        "start": "/app/services",
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "text=Standard home cleaning >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": "text=Step 1 of 6",
            "cut": true
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Next: Scope"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Next: Pricing"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "y": 230
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "text=Bedrooms and bathrooms >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "target": {
              "role": "textbox",
              "name": "Base price"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "type",
            "target": {
              "role": "textbox",
              "name": "Base price"
            },
            "text": "120",
            "clear": true
          },
          {
            "do": "type",
            "target": {
              "role": "textbox",
              "name": "Each extra bedroom"
            },
            "text": "20",
            "clear": true
          },
          {
            "do": "type",
            "target": {
              "role": "textbox",
              "name": "Each extra bathroom"
            },
            "text": "15",
            "clear": true
          },
          {
            "do": "highlight",
            "target": {
              "role": "spinbutton",
              "name": "Base cleaner-time"
            },
            "note": "Time estimates come from the same answers",
            "ms": 2200
          }
        ]
      },
      "minSeconds": 14
    },
    {
      "id": "team",
      "narration": "Time and Team says how many cleaners a visit needs and how long it should run. Dispatch uses this when it staffs the job.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "playwright",
        "start": "/app/services",
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "text=Standard home cleaning >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": "text=of 6",
            "cut": true
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "button:has-text('Time & Team') >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "y": 260
          },
          {
            "do": "highlight",
            "target": "text=Usual crew >> xpath=..",
            "note": "Crew size Dispatch staffs for",
            "ms": 2400
          },
          {
            "do": "pause",
            "ms": 600
          }
        ]
      },
      "minSeconds": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "narration": "On Review, check what the change adds, say why you're making it, and submit it for review. Nothing goes live yet.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "playwright",
        "start": "/app/services",
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "text=Standard home cleaning >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": "text=of 6",
            "cut": true
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "button:has-text('Extras') >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Next: Review"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "y": 260
          },
          {
            "do": "type",
            "target": {
              "role": "textbox",
              "name": "Why this change"
            },
            "text": "Our standard home clean, priced by bedrooms and bathrooms.",
            "delay": 30
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Submit for review"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Submit for review"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": "text=In review",
            "cut": true
          },
          {
            "do": "pause",
            "ms": 900
          }
        ]
      },
      "minSeconds": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "approve",
      "narration": "The change shows the prices it produces for example homes, and what it affects. As the Owner, choose Approve and publish.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "playwright",
        "start": "/app/services/changes",
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": "text=Add Standard home cleaning >> nth=0"
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": "text=Prices before and after",
            "cut": true
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "target": "text=Prices before and after"
          },
          {
            "do": "highlight",
            "target": "text=Prices before and after >> xpath=..",
            "note": "Worked out from your prices",
            "ms": 2400
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "target": "text=What it affects"
          },
          {
            "do": "pause",
            "ms": 1600
          },
          {
            "do": "scroll",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Approve and publish"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "click",
            "target": {
              "role": "button",
              "name": "Approve and publish"
            }
          },
          {
            "do": "waitFor",
            "target": "text=Published",
            "ms": 900
          }
        ]
      },
      "minSeconds": 12
    },
    {
      "id": "live",
      "narration": "It's live, as version one. From now on, new quotes and new visits use it. Visits already booked keep the price they were booked with.",
      "capture": {
        "kind": "playwright",
        "start": "/app/services",
        "actions": [
          {
            "do": "highlight",
